  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p class="lede">A few things to know when exploring and sharing.</p></header>
  <article class="article-body"><h2>Sharing your work</h2><p>Submit accurate information about work you are authorized to share. Projects are reviewed before they appear publicly. Submission does not guarantee publication, a feature, or inclusion in Digivated Picks.</p><h2>Community projects and external links</h2><p>Projects link to independent websites. Review their information, terms, and privacy practices before using a service or making a purchase. A listing is a discovery resource, not a guarantee of a project’s performance.</p><h2>Prompt Packet purchases</h2><p>The <a href="/ui-ux-prompt-packet">Prompt Packet page</a> links to its Gumroad listing. Review the product details and checkout terms there before purchasing. Existing purchasers can use the <a href="/access">access page</a> to activate their purchase.</p><h2>Founding Membership</h2><p>The <a href="/founding-members">Digivated Founding Membership</a> is <a href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/founding-member-pass">sold on Gumroad</a> for $5 USD once, for the first 25 members. It includes full educational carousels, the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, and one featured project submission. Review is required, and a feature is never guaranteed. It is not a subscription. The collection grows as carousels are added. The packet remains available alone for $4 USD once, and the $3 promotional spot remains available. A packet purchase does not include the carousels or the featured submission. Review the Gumroad listing before purchasing. Already purchased? Sign in on the membership page with your license key or purchase email.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digivated on X</a> for questions about this site or a listing.</p></article>
